1
00:00:00,397 --> 00:00:02,277
(Sheldon:)There, there.

2
00:00:05,694 --> 00:00:07,324
God, what is wrong with me?

3
00:00:07,488 --> 00:00:08,908
(Leonard:)Nothing, you're perfect.

4
00:00:09,073 --> 00:00:10,453
Ecch. I'm not perfect.

5
00:00:10,616 --> 00:00:11,906
(Leonard:)Yes, you are.

6
00:00:14,745 --> 00:00:16,915
(Penny:)You really think so, don't you?

7
00:00:31,011 --> 00:00:33,351
- Penny?
- Yeah?

8
00:00:34,389 --> 00:00:37,139
(Leonard:)How much have you had
to drink tonight?

9
00:00:39,103 --> 00:00:42,273
Just... a lot.

10
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:47,070
(Leonard:)Are you sure that your being drunk
and your being angry with Kurt...

11
00:00:47,236 --> 00:00:49,906
(Leonard:)...doesn't have something to do
with what's going on here?

12
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:53,200
(Penny:)It might.

13
00:00:54,701 --> 00:00:55,781
[SIGHS]

14
00:00:55,953 --> 00:00:57,583
(Penny:)Boy, you're really smart.

